{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25265","headline":"惜分阴 · 孟简","name":"惜分阴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"业广因功苦，拳拳志士心。\n九流难酌挹，四海易消沉。\n对景嗟移晷，窥园讵改阴。\n三冬劳聚学，驷景重兼金。\n刺股情方励，偷光思益深。\n再中如可冀，终嗣绝编音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟简","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25265.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25265","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}